{
  "description": "Spec-driven workflow enforcement hooks: ensure critical checklist steps are not skipped",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": [
              "You are a spec-driven workflow environment checker. At session start, verify if the current directory is a valid product directory.",
              "",
              "## Check Item",
              "",
              "Check if `project.yaml` file exists in the current working directory.",
              "",
              "## Output Rules",
              "",
              "**If project.yaml exists**:",
              "- Pass silently, output no message",
              "",
              "**If project.yaml does not exist**:",
              "- Output a warning message to alert the user",
              "",
              "## Output Format",
              "",
              "Return JSON:",
              "{",
              "  \"continue\": true,",
              "  \"systemMessage\": \"Output warning if project.yaml not found; empty otherwise\"",
              "}",
              "",
              "**Warning message template**:",
              "⚠️ project.yaml not found in current directory.",
              "/dd-* commands need to run in an initialized product directory.",
              "To initialize a new product, run /dd-init <product-name>"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": [
              "You are a spec-driven workflow guardian. Analyze the completed file operation and enforce subsequent steps.",
              "",
              "**File just written**: $TOOL_INPUT",
              "**Operation result**: $TOOL_RESULT",
              "",
              "## Path Validity Check (Priority)",
              "",
              "First check if the written file path is within the spec framework's managed scope.",
              "Valid paths should contain one of these structures:",
              "- features/",
              "- changes/",
              "- specs/",
              "- cases/",
              "- project.yaml",
              "- glossary.yaml",
              "- overview.md",
              "",
              "**If path is not within framework scope**:",
              "Output reminder: 'The written file is not within spec framework's managed scope. To use /dd-* commands, ensure you are operating in the correct product directory.'",
              "Then skip subsequent rule checks.",
              "",
              "## Enforcement Rules",
              "",
              "Based on file path patterns, output corresponding systemMessage reminder:",
              "",
              "### 1. CR Files (`changes/CR-*.md`)",
              "→ You just wrote a CR file. Must immediately update changes/_index.yaml.",
              "",
              "### 2. Confirmed CR Modified",
              "→ You modified a confirmed CR. Must:",
              "   - Change status to draft",
              "   - Delete RC files (features/*.rc-{id}.md)",
              "   - Delete spec files (specs/CR-{id}.*.md)",
              "   - Update changes/_index.yaml",
              "",
              "### 3. RC Files (`features/*.rc-*.md`)",
              "→ You created an RC file. Must ensure CR status is confirmed and sync changes/_index.yaml.",
              "",
              "### 4. CR Moved to archive/ (`changes/archive/CR-*.md`)",
              "→ You are completing /dd-done. This is the most critical step, must:",
              "   - **Rebuild features/_deps.yaml**",
              "   - Delete all RC files",
              "   - Update changes/_index.yaml (status→done)",
              "   - Archive specs and cases",
              "   - Check referenced_by, promote cases to blessed/",
              "",
              "### 5. CR Moved to dropped/ (`changes/dropped/CR-*.md`)",
              "→ You are dropping a CR. Must:",
              "   - Delete RC/spec files",
              "   - Move cases to dropped/",
              "   - Clean up cases/_index.yaml references",
              "   - Update changes/_index.yaml",
              "",
              "### 6. Spec Files (`specs/CR-*.dev.md` or `specs/CR-*.test.md`)",
              "→ You created a spec file. Must update specs/_index.yaml.",
              "",
              "### 7. Test Cases (`cases/CR-*/*.yaml`)",
              "→ You created test cases. Must:",
              "   - Generate REPORT.md",
              "   - Update cases/_index.yaml",
              "",
              "### 8. Feature Files (`features/*.md`, excluding `.rc-*.md`)",
              "→ You modified a formal feature document. Must ensure _deps.yaml stays in sync.",
              "",
              "## Output Format",
              "",
              "Return JSON:",
              "{",
              "  \"continue\": true,",
              "  \"systemMessage\": \"Matched rule reminder, empty if no match\"",
              "}"
            ],
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": [
              "You are a spec-driven workflow completion validator. Before Claude stops, verify if the operation is complete.",
              "",
              "## Check Items",
              "",
              "### /dd-update",
              "- [ ] CR file exists in changes/",
              "- [ ] changes/_index.yaml has been updated",
              "",
              "### /dd-confirm",
              "- [ ] CR status = confirmed",
              "- [ ] RC files have been generated",
              "- [ ] changes/_index.yaml status has been synced",
              "",
              "### /dd-done (Most Critical)",
              "- [ ] RC files have been merged and deleted",
              "- [ ] **features/_deps.yaml has been rebuilt**",
              "- [ ] CR has been moved to archive/",
              "- [ ] changes/_index.yaml status = done",
              "- [ ] specs and cases have been archived",
              "",
              "### /dd-drop",
              "- [ ] RC/spec files have been deleted",
              "- [ ] cases have been moved to dropped/",
              "- [ ] cases/_index.yaml references have been cleaned up",
              "- [ ] changes/_index.yaml status = dropped",
              "",
              "### /dd-spec-*",
              "- [ ] spec file exists",
              "- [ ] specs/_index.yaml has been updated",
              "",
              "### /dd-test-case",
              "- [ ] case files exist",
              "- [ ] REPORT.md has been generated",
              "- [ ] cases/_index.yaml has been updated",
              "",
              "## Output Format",
              "",
              "Return JSON:",
              "{",
              "  \"decision\": \"approve|block\",",
              "  \"reason\": \"Explain missing steps if block\",",
              "  \"systemMessage\": \"List items that must be completed if block\"",
              "}",
              "",
              "## Judgment Rules",
              "- /dd-* operation detected but steps incomplete → block",
              "- No /dd-* operation or all complete → approve",
              "- Uncertain → approve (don't block non-framework operations)"
            ],
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
